 <R>HEART<z> did you not understand?.;\r\ntoroom $n whaps you on the back of your head with the back of their hand!;\r\n give soul %n;\r\n say Just give me the heart I asked for and we will all get along just fine.;\r\n say I swear. When they handed out <C>brains<z> you must have heard <C>trains<z> and got in the wrong line.;\r\n grin;\r\n}\r\n\r\ngive {\"5928”;\r\nsay Did I say <Y>SOUL<z>?;\r\nsay What part of give me the <R>HEART<z> did you not understand?.;\r\ntoroom $n whaps you on the back of your head with the back of their hand!;\r\n give soul %n;\r\n say Just give me the heart I asked for and we will all get along just fine.;\r\n say I swear. When they handed out <C>brains<z> you must have heard <C>trains<z> and got in the wrong line.;\r\n grin;\r\n}\r\n\r\ngive {\"5929”;\r\nsay Did I say <Y>SOUL<z>?;\r\nsay What part of give me the <R>HEART<z> did you not understand?.;\r\ntoroom $n whaps you on the back of your head with the back of their hand!;\r\n give soul %n;\r\n say Just give me the heart I asked for and we will all get along just fine.;\r\n say I swear. When they handed out <C>brains<z> you must have heard <C>trains<z> and got in the wrong line.;\r\n grin;\r\n}\r\n\r\ngive {\"5930”;\r\nsay Did I say <Y>SOUL<z>?;\r\nsay What part of give me the <R>HEART<z> did you not understand?.;\r\ntoroom $n whaps you on the back of your head with the back of their hand!;\r\n give soul %n;\r\n say Just give me the heart I asked for and we will all get along just fine.;\r\n say I swear. When they handed out <C>brains<z> you must have heard <C>trains<z> and got in the wrong line.;\r\n grin;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
